fact WorkItem(id: "WI-655", description: some(value: "PERF (directive-2 win surfaced by WI-653 inference/simp profiling): make the typer's [simp] firing skip its per-node type-directed guard for nodes no [simp] rule could match. MEASURED (anthill-todo CLI load, debug, repo project, 117 sorts): fire_simp = ~0.48s of type_check_node, 1681 attempts / 0 actual rewrites; of that, simp_fire_guard_holds (typing.rs ~22920) = ~0.37s / 78%. ROOT CAUSE: simp_rewrite::try_fire (simp_rewrite.rs ~476) calls simp_fire_guard_holds ONCE PER functor-bearing node BEFORE the cheap stored_lhs_functor pre-filter (~499), so every node pays the type-directed carrier-satisfaction guard even when NO [simp] rule's LHS functor matches it -- and such a node can never fire (the match loop rejects it at the functor filter anyway). FIX: gather the set of [simp]-rule LHS functors ONCE per walk (the candidate rids are already gathered once, WI-646) and, in try_fire, return None BEFORE calling the guard when node_functor is not in that set. SOUND / behavior-identical: for a functor-non-matching node the loop returns None regardless of the guard verdict, and simp_fire_guard_holds is side-effect-free (&KnowledgeBase) -- only the wasted guard evaluations are removed, nothing that fires stops firing. Precise gate = LHS functors of the rids that pass is_simp_equation + empty rule_type_bounds (exactly the rids that can reach the functor filter), so a typed-bound rule the typer skips does not keep the guard alive. Recovers most of the ~0.37s; composes with WI-653 caching (direction 3) and also speeds the one-time cache-build. Acceptance: full suite green (existing simp tests still fire where they should -- no behavior change); the guard no longer runs for functor-non-matching nodes (verifiable by the same per-node counter used in the WI-653 profiling); anthill-todo status drops by ~0.3s toward pre-guard timing. Follow-up to WI-653 (its corrected-diagnosis feedback carries the full type_check_sorts breakdown)."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: nil), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-07-07T23:15:14Z"))

fact Tag(workitem: "WI-655", name: "perf")
